<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards"><a class="card rv" href="/free-claim-tools/claim-gap-fee-estimator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><span class="meta">Calculator</span><h2>Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</h2><p>Measure the dispute, test where an award might land and net out appraiser and umpire fees.</p><span class="go">Open the tool</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/free-claim-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kitchen.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kitchen-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kitchen.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><span class="meta">Calculator</span><h2>RCV vs. ACV Holdback Calculator</h2><p>List damaged items by age and life to estimate your first check, the holdback and the final total.</p><span class="go">Open the tool</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/free-claim-tools/roof-area-pitch-estimator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-aerial.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-aerial-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-aerial.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><span class="meta">Calculator</span><h2>Roof Area &amp; Pitch Estimator</h2><p>Turn a footprint and pitch into sloped area, squares, bundles and a steep-charge check.</p><span class="go">Open the tool</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/free-claim-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/coastal-aerial.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/coastal-aerial-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/coastal-aerial.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><span class="meta">Calculator</span><h2>Hurricane Deductible Calculator</h2><p>Convert a percentage hurricane or named-storm deductible into dollars and see what a claim pays.</p><span class="go">Open the tool</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/free-claim-tools/claim-timeline-builder/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><span class="meta">Planner</span><h2>Claim Timeline Builder</h2><p>Map notice, proof of loss, holdback and suit dates from your date of loss, then export to a calendar.</p><span class="go">Open the tool</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/free-claim-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation-2.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-2-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation-2.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><span class="meta">Checklist</span><h2>Appraisal Readiness Checkup</h2><p>Twelve yes/no questions that score your claim file and build a to-do list before you demand appraisal.</p><span class="go">Open the tool</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/free-claim-tools/wind-flood-damage-splitter/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flood-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flood-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flood-street.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><span class="meta">Calculator</span><h2>Wind vs. Flood Damage Splitter</h2><p>Split a hurricane loss between a wind policy and a flood policy to see who pays what — and what’s left.</p><span class="go">Open the tool</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap two top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the tools together</h2><ol><li>Start with the <a href="/free-claim-tools/claim-timeline-builder/">claim timeline builder</a> so no deadline slips.</li><li>Check roof math with the <a href="/free-claim-tools/roof-area-pitch-estimator/">roof area &amp; pitch estimator</a>.</li><li>See what you’ll collect with the <a href="/free-claim-tools/hurricane-deductible-calculator/">hurricane deductible</a>, <a href="/free-claim-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">holdback</a> and <a href="/free-claim-tools/wind-flood-damage-splitter/">wind vs. flood</a> calculators.</li><li>Size the dispute with the <a href="/free-claim-tools/claim-gap-fee-estimator/">claim gap &amp; fee estimator</a>.</li><li>Finish with the <a href="/free-claim-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">readiness checkup</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="box call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through first</h2><p>A free first conversation. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="big" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn cu" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
